{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"95819","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/95819","key":"MC-258535","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"15/Dec/22 7:57 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p><b>The Bug:</b><br>\nEnd crystals do the same damage across difficulties in 1.19.3. This also applies to TNT explosions.<br>\nThis is what the damage looks like when you stand in the middle of one:</p>\n\n<p><b>1.19.2 and previous versions:</b><br>\nPeaceful: 0 hp / 0 full hearts<br>\nEasy: 43.5 hp/ 21.75 full hearts<br>\nNormal: 85 hp / 42.5 full hearts<br>\nHard: 127.5 hp / 63.75 full hearts</p>\n\n<p><b>1.19.3:</b><br>\nPeaceful: 85 hp / 42.5 full hearts<br>\nEasy: 85 hp / 42.5hp full hearts<br>\nNormal: 85 hp / 42.5 hp full hearts<br>\nHard: 85 hp / 42.5 hp full hearts&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><b>Steps to reproduce:</b></p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Set the difficulty to anything other than normal, such as hard, peaceful, or easy.</li>\n\t<li>Spawn an end crystal.</li>\n\t<li>Observe that the end crystal does the same damage as it would on normal difficulty.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p><b>Expected behavior:</b><br>\nThe damage from an end crystal should do the same as on version 1.19.2 and before that.</p>\n\n<p><b>Actual behavior:</b><br>\nThe same damage that end crystals do on normal difficulty is the same as on other difficulties.</p>\n\n<p><b>Code analysis:</b><br>\nCode analysis by <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=etch\" rel=\"noreferrer\">etch</a> can be found in <a href=\"https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC-258535?focusedId=1217040&amp;page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-1217040\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">this comment</a>.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"15/Dec/22 4:20 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[],"versions":null,"resolutiondate":"17/Feb/23 3:03 PM","issuelinks":null,"updated":"20/Aug/26 4:21 AM","status":null},"fields":{"summary":"End crystal and TNT explosions do same damage regardless of difficulty","issuetype":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issuetype/10006","id":"10006","description":"A problem which impairs or prevents the functions of the product. (Migrated on 23 Jan 2025 19:08 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium","name":"Bug","subtask":false,"avatarId":10303,"hierarchyLevel":0},"watches":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/MC-258535/watchers","watchCount":1,"isWatching":false},"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":null,"created":"2022-12-15T07:57:58.190-0800","customfield_10050":null,"customfield_10051":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10098","value":"Platform","id":"10098"},"description":{"type":"doc","version":1,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Bug:","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"End crystals do the same damage across difficulties in 1.19.3. This also applies to TNT explosions."},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"This is what the damage looks like when you stand in the middle of one:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"1.19.2 and previous versions:","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"Peaceful: 0 hp / 0 full hearts"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"Easy: 43.5 hp/ 21.75 full hearts"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"Normal: 85 hp / 42.5 full hearts"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"Hard: 127.5 hp / 63.75 full hearts"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"te